        "Increase password length, enable lockout controls, and add MFA where appropriate.",
        "Keep the existing default passwords on all service accounts purely for convenience."
      ],
      "correctAnswer": 2
    },
    {
      "persona": "Hacktivist",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Imani Vale:</b> Northbridge will implement whichever line is easiest to defend in a meeting, so the recommendation has to be the strong one and the reasonable one at the same time.\n\nAnd it has to protect the people who never got to choose their own security posture: the residents whose records sit behind these accounts and had no vote on the rules guarding them.",
